  "text": "\n     General Election is Tuesday, November 3 • Lebanon, NH \n Skip to Main Content \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n     Your Government   \t\t\t \n     Resident Resources   \t\t\t \n     Business Resources   \t\t\t \n     Life in Lebanon   \t\t\t \n     How Do I?   \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t Search \n         Subscribe \n         LebAnswers \n         Agendas, Minutes, and Meetings \n         Landfill \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\nHome \n                News Flash\nGeneral Election is Tuesday, November 3 \nNews Flash \n            General Election is Tuesday, November 3\n                Lebanon City Clerk \n                Posted on October 08, 2026 \nNew Hampshire’s General Election will be held Tuesday, November 3, 2026. Polls in all three Lebanon wards will be open from 7:00am to 7:00pm. \nPolling Locations \nLebanon polling locations are: \nWard 1: SAU 88 Administrative Office, 20 Seminary Hill Road, West Lebanon \nWard 2: United Methodist Church, 18 School Street, Lebanon \nWard 3: City Council Chambers, City Hall, 51 North Park Street, Lebanon \nWhere is my polling location? \nNot sure which ward or polling location to use? Your polling location is based on where you live. To determine your polling location, you can: \nVisit the  State of NH Voter Information Lookup Website  and enter your address. \nConsult the  ward-by-street list on our website.  Review the list carefully, as some streets are split between wards. \nAbsentee Voting \nNew Hampshire does not offer early voting. Qualifying voters may vote by absentee ballot. Completed absentee ballots must be received by the City Clerk’s Office no later than 5:00pm on Election Day, Tuesday, November 3, 2026, to be counted. Do not place absentee ballots in the green drop box outside City Hall, as these cannot be counted. \nInformation about requesting, completing, and returning an absentee ballot is available at  LebanonNH.gov/Absentee . \nRegistering to Vote \nEligible voters who are not already registered may register and vote at their polling location on Election Day with the Supervisors of the Checklist for voter registration. Registration requirements and additional voter information are available on the  Voter Registration Information  webpage.  \nNot sure if you are registered? Use the  State of New Hampshire Voter Lookup  website to verify if you are registered to vote and your party affiliation. \nVisit  LebanonNH.gov/Election  to view sample ballots and find more election and voter information. \nQuestions? Contact the City Clerk’s Office at 603-448-3054 or use the  secure contact form . \nRelated News \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t53 Ways to Get Involved!\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tLebanon City Clerk \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPosted on August 13, 2026 | Last Updated on August 13, 2026\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPawsitively #1: Lebanon’s 2026 Top Dog!\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tLebanon City Clerk \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPosted on July 20, 2026 \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tState of NH Budget Passes with New Motor Vehicle Fee Schedule\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tLebanon City Clerk \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPosted on November 13, 2025 | Last Updated on November 13, 2025\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPlan Ahead: NH DMV Requires Appointments for All Services\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tLebanon City Clerk \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPosted on November 03, 2025 \n\t\t\t Agendas,  \nMinutes,  \nand Meetings \r\n\t\t\t Maps and Property \nInformation \r\n\t\t\t Forms, Permits, \nand Applications \r\n\t\t\t Ask LebNH or \nReport an Issue \r\n\t\t\t Subscribe to \nLebNews and \nLebAlerts \r\n\t\t\t Pay Your \nBill Online \r\nContact Us \r\nCity of Lebanon \r\nCity Hall \r\n51 N Park Street \r\nLebanon, NH 03766 \nCity Directory and Hours \r\nQuick Links \r\n         Ask LebNH \n         Pay Online \n         Sign Up for Alerts \n         View Employment Listings \n         City Homepage \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\nSite Links \r\n         Accessibility \n         Copyright Notices \n         Privacy Policy \n         Social Media Policy \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n   Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
